{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09151","headline":"谢栎阳令归西郊赠别诸友生 · 韦应物","name":"谢栎阳令归西郊赠别诸友生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结发仕州县，蹉跎在文墨。\n徒有排云心，何由生羽翼。\n幸遭明盛日，万物蒙生植。\n独此抱微痾，颓然谢斯职。\n世道方荏苒，郊园思偃息。\n爲欢日已延，君子情未极。\n驰觞忽云晏，高论良难测。\n游步清都宫，迎风嘉树侧。\n晨起西郊道，原野分黍稷。\n自乐陶唐人，服勤在微力。\n伫君列丹陛，出处两爲得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}